{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>Is it not hidden with me.</b> The words of HaShem, may He be exalted, concerning the decrees. And \"close to me\" — it is their wine, which is the head of serpents; it is kept until they drink it. And the word כמוס is known from the grammatical standpoint, for it has no [root] family." "<b>Sealed in my treasuries.</b> That no hand touches it; rather, it is kept for them, to take vengeance upon them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {0 "Resolved י״‎א as standard honorific abbreviation for ישתבח / יתברך, rendered 'may He be exalted'."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:26:09.652365355Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}